Here's a bash script that you may use in addition to the problem description for the sake of completeness:

```bash
#!/bin/bash

while read -r line
do
  case "$line" in
    *"@@@"*) echo "<code>Debug.Assert(${line#*\@*\@*\ });</code>";;
  esac
done
